 ---
 Create listing — 4-step wizard

 Step 1 — Details (JSON)

 POST /listings
 Authorization: Bearer {token}
 Content-Type: application/json
 Body:
 {
   "title": "3BHK Family Flat – Dhanmondi",
   "type": "Family",
   "price": 35000,
   "beds": 3,
   "baths": 2,
   "deposit": 70000,
   "size": 1200,
   "description": "Spacious flat with great view...",
   "amenities": [1, 3, 5]
 }
 - type must be one of: Family, Bachelor, Student, Couple, Sublet
 - amenities is an array of amenity IDs (get IDs from GET /amenities)
 - deposit, size, description, amenities are optional

 Response 201:
 {
   "id": "uuid",
   "message": "Listing draft created. Upload photos to submit for review.",
   "listing_step": 2
 }

 ▎ Save the id — you need it for steps 2, 3, and 4.

 ---
 Step 2 — Photos (multipart)

 POST /listings/{id}/photos
 Authorization: Bearer {token}
 Content-Type: multipart/form-data
 Body:
 photos[]: file (jpg/jpeg/png, max 5MB each, at least 1 required)
 photos[]: file
 photos[]: file

 ▎ Flutter: send as MultipartFile list under the key photos[]

 Response 200:
 { "listing_step": 3 }

 ---
 Step 3 — Location (JSON)

 PATCH /listings/{id}/location
 Authorization: Bearer {token}
 Content-Type: application/json
 Body:
 {
   "area": "Dhanmondi",
   "division_id": 3,
   "district_id": 10,
   "upazila_id": 50,
   "union_id": 200,
   "road_and_house": "House 12, Road 7, Dhanmondi",
   "coord_x": 23.7461,
   "coord_y": 90.3742
 }
 - area is required; all others are optional
 - Get division_id → district_id → upazila_id → union_id by chaining the Geo APIs (Phase 6)

 Response 200:
 { "listing_step": 4 }

 ---
 Step 4 — Preview + Submit

 Show the user a preview using GET /listings/{id} (public endpoint, no auth needed).

 Then submit:
 POST /listings/{id}/submit
 Authorization: Bearer {token}
 No body needed.

 Response 200:
 {
   "message": "Listing submitted for review.",
   "listing": { "...full listing object..." }
 }

 Response 422 — missing location:
 { "message": "Location is required. Please complete Step 3 first.", "code": "INCOMPLETE" }
 Response 422 — missing photos:
 { "message": "At least one photo is required. Please complete Step 2 first.", "code": "INCOMPLETE" }

