 Phase 5 — Notifications

 Get notifications

 GET /notifications
 Authorization: Bearer {token}
 Response 200:
 {
   "data": [
     {
       "id": "uuid",
       "kind": "message | listing",
       "title": "string",
       "body": "string",
       "time": "2 hours ago",
       "is_unread": true,
       "reference_id": "uuid"
     }
   ]
 }

 ▎ kind=message → reference_id is chat_id → open that chat
 ▎ kind=listing → reference_id is listing_id → open that listing

 ---
 Mark one as read

 PATCH /notifications/{id}/read
 Authorization: Bearer {token}
 Response 200: { "message": "Marked as read" }

 Mark all as read

 PATCH /notifications/read-all
 Authorization: Bearer {token}
 Response 200: { "message": "All marked as read" }

