 ---
 Listing status — UI logic

 draft    → only owner can see it (still filling the wizard)
 pending  → submitted, awaiting admin approval
 active   → live in public feed
 rejected → admin rejected, owner is notified
 rented   → owner marks it rented (future)

 ---
 Token management (important)

 1. Store access_token + refresh_token in secure storage (flutter_secure_storage)
 2. On every API call: if you get HTTP 401 → call POST /auth/refresh
 3. If refresh also fails (401) → clear tokens, send user to login screen

     1. Store access_token + refresh_token in secure storage (flutter_secure_storage)
     2. On every API call: if you get HTTP 401 → call POST /auth/refresh
     3. If refresh also fails (401) → clear tokens, send user to login screen
     4. On logout: call POST /auth/logout then clear both tokens from storage

